  "solution": {
    "text": "Since diode <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">D</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math> is reverse biased, therefore it will act as an open circuit.<br />The effective resistance of the circuit is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> .<br />Current in the circuit is <math> <mrow> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">I</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">E</mtext> <mo>/</mo> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>12</mtext> <mo>/</mo> <mn>6</mn> <mo>=</mo> </mrow> </math> 2 A.",
